[What completing general chemistry means](research/Completion.lingua#r_0F3AN0M8QY98NA42NVQS00D48F) describes what the full learning programme asks a reader to demonstrate. [General chemistry sources — books, courses, data, and research](Sources.lingua#r_37CHT3QSMD33JDMXE59S6M2ME3) identifies the assigned books, university courses, primary definitions, evaluated data, practical manuals, and optional external study tools. Source media stay external; the original numerical example is inline and can be saved in a personal exercise area.

[Chemistry — substances, transformations, and evidence](../Chemistry.lingua#r_2NWJY1HCKPBM4T6YQSDHN8S3S0), [Ergon — useful labor and productive knowledge](../../../Ergon.lingua#r_FE78A5A2D2A3261F711703DCC1), [Inquiry — shared ways to understand and investigate](../../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB), [Hephaestus](../../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001), and [Philosophy](../../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001) connect this foundation with the wider body of knowledge. The material-chain studies point toward the full specialist extraction-to-chip pathways, whose unique theory and practice remain substantial work.

Follow the links directly or select both endpoints of #general-chemistry assertions through an ordinary Protein. Five shared learning Records retain their other continuations. Discovery imports load referenced definitions without defining the selected learning boundary; source and other-subject references do not recursively join the route. No views directory, manifest, or additional Trail feature is required.

**Continue:** [Begin general chemistry from zero](Reading-from-zero.lingua#r_0470T6ZDV7KCP63TE2D5GX9ANG).
